process.rule:
After creating the task file (and any stub docs), stage and commit:
- git add .festinalente/tasks/{id}/task.xml
- If product stub doc was created: git add {newDocPath}
- If engineering stub doc was created: git add {newEngDocPath}
- git commit -m "docs({id}): create - {title}"

After creating the project file, task files, and any stub docs, stage and commit:
- git add .festinalente/projects/{projectId}/project.xml
- For each created task: git add .festinalente/tasks/{taskId}/task.xml
- If product stub doc was created: git add {newDocPath}
- If engineering stub doc was created: git add {newEngDocPath}
- git commit -m "docs({projectId}): create-project - {title}"
